# Geopolitics and Vendor Models — Who Owns the AI Tools Our Agency Depends On?

This chapter helps a small marketing agency choose AI tools while keeping control over its client information, working methods and ability to change providers.

**Team:** ai-business-handbook  
**Course:** HAN — AIBS × AEL, 2026  
**Version:** 0.1 — draft for team and peer review  
**Target audience:** Marketing and advertising agencies in the Netherlands with approximately 10–50 employees  
**Illustrative SME:** A fictional 20-person marketing agency; this is not an account of an interview or a tested implementation  
**Sources consulted:** 14 September 2026  

